/tmp/arxiv2305.14047.34Gdm0/src/DC_Framework.tex:63:\KwIn{A graph $G=(V,E)$, $0.5 \leq \gamma\leq 1$, and $\theta>0$}
/tmp/arxiv2305.14047.34Gdm0/src/DC_Framework.tex:65:{\cheng Reduce} $G=(V,E)$ as a $\lceil \gamma \cdot (\theta-1) \rceil$-core of $G$\;
