/tmp/arxiv2305.14047.34Gdm0/src/problem.tex:167:%We adopt the state-of-the-art implementation for solving the subset query problem, which answers the query \texttt{GetAllSubsets} in $O(\min\{|\mathcal{S}|\cdot \omega,2^{2\omega}\})$ where $\omega$ is the degeneracy of the input graph $G$. Hence, to solve the NMQCF problem, we need at most $|\mathcal{S}|$ query and thus have the running time bounded by $O(\min\{|\mathcal{S}|^2\cdot \omega, |\mathcal{S}|\cdot 2^{2\omega}\})$ (which is polynomial in $|\mathcal{S}|$). We put the details of implementation and analysis in the technique report~\cite{}.
