    11	    \item \textbf{Partial set} $S$. Set of vertices that \emph{must} be included in every vertex set within the branch. 
    12	    \item \textbf{Candidate set} $C$. Set of vertices that \emph{may} be included in $S$ in order to form larger vertex sets within the branch.
    13	    \item \textbf{Exclusion set} $D$. Set of vertices that \emph{must not} be included in any vertex set within the branch.
