    10	has been widely studied in the past~\cite{pei2005mining,jiang2009mining,zeng2006coherent,liu2008effective,khalil2022parallel,guo2020scalable} and used for various applications such as discovering biologically relevant functional groups~\cite{harley2001uniform,bader2003automated,bhattacharyya2009mining,bu2003topological}, finding social communities~\cite{fang2020survey,guo2022maximal}, detecting anomaly~\cite{yu2021graph,tanner2010koobface,weiss2015tracking}, etc. 
