"""Verified quasi-clique problem generator derived from arXiv:2305.14047.

The module inverse-generates one large induced gamma-quasi-clique before it
draws the rest of the graph.  The planted vertices are sampled uniformly and
their lower cross-edge rate is chosen to match the expected total degree of a
background vertex.  The witness is a vertex set; verification is exact and
does not attempt the paper's NP-hard maximality test.
"""

