codex
The honest baseline now works, but its 24-dimensional cost is only about 9,500 field operations. I’m strengthening the fixed shipping preset without enlarging the field: dimension 96 makes Gaussian elimination a genuine tool-scale computation, while finite-field exponent folding keeps the intended common-root route near 215 operations and the certificate below the 256-atom cap.
apply patch
