 ```text
-0: 1 2 4 5 6 10
-1: 0 2 3 6 7 8 9
-2: 0 1 3 4 6 8 9 11
-3: 1 2 4 7 8
-4: 0 2 3 5 7 8 9
-5: 0 4 9 11
